  "label": "User projected onto the celebratory political rally scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene of David Cameron at a political rally, where the celebratory atmosphere and the visual material of the supporters are juxtaposed with the hateful text. The user is implicitly invited to see themselves as part of the celebratory crowd or as the one who understands the 'data' referenced in the text, even though the text is inflammatory and false. The scene serves as the primary visual anchor for the user's interpretation of the meme's message.",
